# tuned/repo.env -- ollama-specific settings for tuned builds. Sourced by tuned/env.sh after the shared
# device and toolkit definitions (tuned/common-data, from zbrad/tuned-common). Tracked, so a release is
# reproducible.
#
# This file may only ADD repo-specific settings. Changing any shared key (GPU_TUNED_*, CUDA_*, TOOLKIT_*) is a
# loud error from env.sh.
#
# Plain assignment on purpose: this file is sourced inside a function, where `declare` would make the
# variable local and lose it.

# Upstream this fork tracks, for the build-info stamp's upstream.base / nearest_tag. Declared, never guessed
# (ollama/ollama's default branch is main).
GPU_TUNED_UPSTREAM_REF=upstream/main
